tical behavior therapy treatment and several studies have noted dropout rat=
es between 20 and 50% [9.10]. Dropout from treatment has been associated wi=
th a higher risk of self-injury and suicide within this population [<span c=
lass=3D"footers"><span class=3D"tooltip"><span class=3D"tooltiptext">Barnic=
