on-link" href=3D"https://mental.jmir.org/2020/6/e14913/#ref7" rel=3D"footno=
te">7</a></span></span>] has a solid evidence base that demonstrates its ef=
fectiveness in treating personality disorders. The therapy was initially de=
veloped to help patients with self-injurious and suicidal behavior [<span c=
lass=3D"footers"><span class=3D"tooltip"><span class=3D"tooltiptext">Panos =
PT, Jackson JW, Hasan O, Panos A. Meta-analysis and systematic review asses=
sing the efficacy of dialectical behavior therapy (DBT). Research on Social=
 Work Practice.  Sep 19, 2013;24(2):213-223. [<a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"=
